Vorticity evolution on a wavelet-adaptive MRAG grid.

WARP adaptive particle solver (blockprocessingWARP.h): a Gaussian vortex is advected
(RK3 + MP4 remesh) in the prescribed LeVeque single-vortex deformation field, which
winds it into a spiral filament; the grid re-adapts each step by wavelet detail
(hysteresis rtol=ctol/10, Refiner_SpaceExtension) and refines along the filament.

Compile
    make

Run (writes omega.NNNN.xdmf2 + .raw)
    make run

Iso-line postprocessing (amriso)
    python3 -m pip install --user git+https://github.com/cselab/amriso
    ./post.py omega.xdmf2 --iso 0.5 --out iso

View
    paraview omega.xdmf2 iso.xdmf2
